## What to return
A JSON object with:
- "analysis": at most 120 words on what the results so far suggest.
- "proposals": exactly 4 objects, each with "hypothesis" (one or two sentences: what changes, why it should help, what result would refute it) and "config" (a complete config using only the knobs and values above).
Proposals may repeat an earlier config only to test noise, and should say so.
